@startuml
title Mentory — модель стадии продукта / 2026-05-25

left to right direction

state "0. Концепт / отчет" as concept
state "1. Кликабельный прототип" as prototype
state "2. Функциональный MVP" as mvp
state "3. Demo-ready alpha" as alpha
state "4. Beta product" as beta
state "5. Production-grade product" as prod

concept --> prototype : Figma / DOCX
prototype --> mvp : core domains implemented
mvp --> alpha : текущая стадия\n(feature-complete enough\nfor supervised demo)
alpha --> beta : нужен UX polish,\nrequest flows,\nsubscription payment,\nseed data
beta --> prod : нужны real providers,\nNFR evidence,\nops runbooks,\nmonitoring/SLA

note bottom of alpha
  Текущая оценка:
  65-70% от идеального продукта.
  Архитектурная база и широкие flows есть.
  Главные gaps: UI/UX polish,
  demo data и production readiness.
end note

@enduml
